  "is_system_action": false,
  "is_stateful": true,
  "function_man_page_doc": "Input {bid_job, bids} -> {winner_subject_id, status, result_data}. Excludes declined and bid_rejected bids, then scores survivors on budget (a), weighted sizing (b), compliance (c) and live endpoint accuracy (d), each out of 100. Endpoint scoring calls each company's registered va-uc-* functions through AgentFunctions with the sample images on bid_job_metadata.evaluation. Ties break on lowest total_budget then subject id.",
